  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will support the Confederation of employers of Azerbaijan (ASK) in improving their communication and relations with its members and provision of better and more timely services by installing client relations management tool and training of the secretariat on its effective use. Also, the ILO will support ASK in developing and implementing a dedicated and coherent membership strategy to tackle the low level of engagement of members and stimulate more even membership growth.</narrative>
  </description>
